{"speciesId":255,"names":{"fr":"Poussifeu","es":"Torchic","en":"Torchic","ja":"アチャモ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"TORCHIC sticks with its TRAINER, following behind with unsteady steps. This POKéMON breathes fire of over 1,800 degrees F, including fireballs that leave the foe scorched black."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"TORCHIC has a place inside its body where it keeps its flame. Give it a hug - it will be glowing with warmth. This POKéMON is covered all over by a fluffy coat of down."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"If attacked, it strikes back by spitting balls of fire it forms in its stomach. A TORCHIC dislikes darkness because it can’t see its surroundings."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It has a flame sac inside its belly that perpetually burns. It feels warm if it is hugged."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It has a flame sac inside its belly that perpetually burns. It feels warm if it is hugged."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"A fire burns inside, so it feels very warm to hug. It launches fireballs of 1,800 degrees F."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"A fire burns inside, so it feels very warm to hug. It launches fireballs of 1,800 degrees F."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"A fire burns inside, so it feels very warm to hug. It launches fireballs of 1,800 degrees F."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Inside its body is a place where it keeps a small flame. Hug it! It will be as warm as a hot-water bottle."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Inside its body is a place where it keeps a small flame. Hug it! It will be as warm as a hot-water bottle."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Ses câlins réchauffent car il renferme une fournaise. Il envoie des boules de feu à 1 000 °C."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"A fire burns inside, so it feels very warm to hug. It launches fireballs of 1,800 degrees F."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Ses câlins réchauffent car il renferme une fournaise. Il envoie des boules de feu à 1 000 °C."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"A fire burns inside, so it feels very warm to hug. It launches fireballs of 1,800 degrees F."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"A fire burns inside, so it feels very warm to hug. It launches fireballs of 1,800 degrees F."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"A fire burns inside, so it feels very warm to hug. It launches fireballs of 1,800 degrees F."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Poussifeu possède, dans son ventre, une poche de feu qui brûle sans arrêt. Il donne une impression de chaleur quand on lui fait des câlins."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"En su interior, guarda una llama que arde sin cesar. Si se le abraza, se nota que tiene una temperatura muy alta."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It has a flame sac inside its belly that perpetually burns. It feels warm if it is hugged."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"お腹に 炎袋を 持つ。 抱きしめると ぽかぽか 温かい。 命ある 限り 燃え続ける。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Ses câlins réchauffent car il renferme une fournaise. Il envoie des boules de feu à 1 000 °C."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"En su interior arde una llama que mantiene su cuerpo caliente. Tira bolas de fuego a 1000 °C."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"A fire burns inside, so it feels very warm to hug. It launches fireballs of 1,800 degrees Fahrenheit."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"体内で 炎が 燃えているので 抱きしめると とても 温かい。 １０００度の 火の玉を 飛ばす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Poussifeu ne lâche pas son Dresseur d’une semelle, marchant maladroitement derrière lui. Ce Pokémon crache des flammes pouvant atteindre 1 000 °C et des boules de feu qui carbonisent l’ennemi."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Torchic no se separa de su Entrenador. Siempre va tras él con sus pasitos inseguros. Este Pokémon escupe bolas de fuego que pueden alcanzar los 1000 °C y carbonizar al enemigo."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Torchic sticks with its Trainer, following behind with unsteady steps. This Pokémon breathes fire of over 1,800 degrees Fahrenheit, including fireballs that leave the foe scorched black."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"トレーナーに くっついて ちょこちょこ 歩く。 口から 飛ばす 炎は 摂氏 １０００度。 相手を 黒コゲにする 灼熱の 玉だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Poussifeu dispose d’un endroit dans son corps pour stocker sa flamme. Si on lui fait un gros câlin, sa flamme s’illumine chaleureusement. Ce Pokémon est couvert d’un duvet très doux."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Torchic tiene un lugar en el interior de su organismo en el que guarda la llama que posee. Si le das un abrazo, arderá encantado. Este Pokémon está recubierto totalmente de sedoso plumón."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Torchic has a place inside its body where it keeps its flame. Give it a hug—it will be glowing with warmth. This Pokémon is covered all over by a fluffy coat of down."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"体内に 炎を 燃やす 場所が あるので 抱きしめると ぽかぽか とっても 暖かい。 全身 ふかふかの 羽毛に 覆われている。"}],"varieties":[{"id":255,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"scratch","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"cut","learns"